            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'> on Infrequent Retention </run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>⁴</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10' italic='true'>DH-Incentivized infrequent customer orders (%) and % of incentives spent on DH-funded infrequent customer orders</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </title>
      </layout-options>
